The relay probability is 40%, which means that 4 out of every 10 agents relay tokens, while the other 60% act without relaying. The `relay_tokens` method drops one token per relay operation, effectively reducing the likelihood of relaying by 20% per agent. This is a trade-off between the agent's survival rate and the cost of relays.

